CuboKit (a Swift package the app is built with)
================================================================================

The app links CuboKit (https://github.com/mac4DSTEM/CuboKit, tag 0.9.0, commit
9c5365eede096a5f562fb402ee869b8f35eb2c57), Copyright (C) 2026 Paul Lobpreis, GPL-3.0-or-later,
