Also from EPQ, for computed k-factors (labelled unvalidated in the app):
`SalvatXionA.csv`, `SalvatXionB.csv` and `xionUis.csv` (the Bote-Salvat inner-shell
ionisation cross-section coefficients and edge energies; EPQ's
AbsoluteIonizationCrossSection.java credits D. Bote, F. Salvat, A. Jablonski and
